{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Companion-twist B and C diagonalization: new conventions\n\nPorted from `old-conventions/old/Gaudin/Companion-B-C-diagonalize-convention-change.nb` (2026-10-01). This is the reference for the new conventions.\n\n- **Model.** XXX chain at one site, gl(3), physical rep $\\Lambda=\\{2,1,0\\}$ (the adjoint, dim 8), in the Gelfand–Tsetlin basis.\n- **Lax.** $\\mathcal{L}_{ij}(u) = u\\,\\delta_{ij} + h\\,E_{ij}$. The old convention (`paper/xxxCG.tex`) was $u - h\\sum E_{ji}\\otimes e_{ij}$.\n- **Twist.** Companion $G$ built from $\\chi_k$, the elementary symmetric polynomials of $z$. It acts on the right: $T^G = \\mathcal{L}\\cdot G$.\n- **B and C.** Both are built from the *untwisted* $T$. The SoV bases $\\langle x|$ and $|y\\rangle$ are built from twisted fused transfer matrices.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## gl(3) representation (GT patterns and generators)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Λ, ν];\nΛ[1] = {2, 1, 0};\n(* ν[n] is the n-th vacuum eigenvalue factor of the diagonal Lax entries (one site) *)\nν[n_][u_] := Product[u - θ[l] + h*Λ[l][[n]], {l, 1}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "χ[1] = z[1] + z[2] + z[3];\nχ[2] = z[1]*z[2] + z[1]*z[3] + z[2]*z[3];\nχ[3] = z[1]*z[2]*z[3];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Lax, companion twist, quantum minors, transfer matrices",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ℒ, T, TG];\nEe[α_][i_, j_] := Ee[α][i, j] = JJ[i, j, Λ[α]];\n(* new convention: + h E_ij, no transpose *)\nℒ[α_][i_, j_][u_] := ℒ[α][i, j][u] = u*IdentityMatrix[dim[Λ[α]]]*KroneckerDelta[i, j] + h*Ee[α][i, j];\nG = {{χ[1], -χ[2], χ[3]}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nT[{i_, j_}][u_] := T[i, j][u] = ℒ[1][i, j][u - θ[1]];\nTG[{i_, j_}][u_] := TG[i, j][u] = Sum[ℒ[1][i, k][u - θ[1]]*G[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\nEE[i_, j_] := Ee[1][i, j];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[QM, tG, QMG];\n(* quantum minors, rows Ii / columns Jj, with argument shifts u, u-h, ...; QMG uses the twisted monodromy *)\nQM[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := QM[Ii, Jj][u] = Sum[Signature[Permutations[Ii][[σ]]]*Dot @@ (T[#1][Last[Flatten[u + h - h*Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[σ]], Jj}], #1]]]] &) /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[σ]], Jj}], {σ, 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\nQMG[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := QMG[Ii, Jj][u] = Sum[Signature[Permutations[Ii][[σ]]]*Dot @@ (TG[#1][Last[Flatten[u + h - h*Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[σ]], Jj}], #1]]]] &) /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[σ]], Jj}], {σ, 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\ntG[a_][u_] := tG[a][u] = Sum[QMG[Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[t];\n(* fused twisted transfer matrices t_{λ1,λ2} (two-row Young diagrams) *)\nt[{0, 0}][u_] := t[{0, 0}][u] = Simplify[IdentityMatrix[8]];\nt[{1, 0}][u_] := t[{1, 0}][u] = Simplify[tG[1][u]];\nt[{1, 1}][u_] := t[{1, 1}][u] = Simplify[tG[2][u]];\nt[{2, 0}][u_] := t[{2, 0}][u] = Simplify[tG[1][u] . tG[1][u + h] - tG[2][u + h]];\nt[{2, 1}][u_] := t[{2, 1}][u] = Simplify[tG[2][u] . tG[1][u + h] - tG[3][u + h]];\nt[{2, 2}][u_] := t[{2, 2}][u] = Simplify[tG[2][u] . tG[2][u + h] - tG[3][u + h] . tG[1][u]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## B and C operators (untwisted T)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Bb, Cc];\n(* C is B without the +h shift in the quantum minors *)\nBb[u_] = T[{1, 1}][u] . QM[{1, 2}, {1, 2}][u + h] + T[{2, 1}][u] . QM[{1, 2}, {1, 3}][u + h];\nCc[u_] = T[{1, 1}][u] . QM[{1, 2}, {1, 2}][u] + T[{2, 1}][u] . QM[{1, 2}, {1, 3}][u];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## ⟨x| eigenbasis of B\nBuilt from the highest-weight covector with twisted transfer matrices at $\\theta_1-2h$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[x];\nx[{{2}, {2, 1}}] = {{1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}};\nx[{{2}, {1, 1}}] = x[{{2}, {2, 1}}] . t[{1, 0}][θ[1] - 2*h];\nx[{{1}, {1, 1}}] = x[{{2}, {2, 1}}] . t[{1, 1}][θ[1] - 2*h];\nx[{{2}, {2, 0}}] = x[{{2}, {2, 1}}] . t[{2, 0}][θ[1] - 2*h] . Inverse[t[{1, 0}][θ[1] - 2*h]];\nx[{{2}, {1, 0}}] = x[{{2}, {2, 0}}] . t[{1, 0}][θ[1] - 2*h];\nx[{{2}, {0, 0}}] = x[{{2}, {2, 0}}] . t[{2, 0}][θ[1] - 2*h];\nx[{{1}, {1, 0}}] = x[{{2}, {2, 0}}] . t[{1, 1}][θ[1] - 2*h];\nx[{{1}, {0, 0}}] = x[{{2}, {2, 0}}] . t[{2, 1}][θ[1] - 2*h];\ngtpats = {{{2}, {2, 1}}, {{2}, {1, 1}}, {{1}, {1, 1}}, {{2}, {2, 0}}, {{2}, {1, 0}}, {{2}, {0, 0}}, {{1}, {1, 0}}, {{1}, {0, 0}}};",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* check ⟨x_μ|B(u) = (u-θ+hμ11+h)(u-θ+hμ21)(u-θ+hμ22)⟨x_μ| for all 8 patterns; expect {0} *)\nUnion[Flatten[Simplify[Table[x[μ] . Bb[u] - x[μ]*(u - θ[1] + h*μ[[1]][[1]] + h)*(u - θ[1] + h*μ[[2]][[1]])*(u - θ[1] + h*μ[[2]][[2]]), {μ, gtpats}]]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"0\" data-out-n=\"44\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"13\" data-sub-start=\"1\" data-sub-end=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[44]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezBccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[44]= \\left\\{0\\right\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "2167c6fb-7b67-4eae-8a97-cbc7601de5a9"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## |y⟩ eigenbasis of C\nBuilt from the lowest-weight vector with shifted transfer matrices at $\\theta_1$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "tS[{1, 0}][u_] = t[{1, 0}][u];\ntS[{1, 1}][u_] = t[{1, 1}][u + h];\ntS[{2, 0}][u_] = t[{2, 0}][u - h];\ntS[{2, 1}][u_] = tG[2][u + h] . tG[1][u - h] - tG[3][u + h];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[y];\ny[{{1}, {0, 0}}] = Transpose[{{0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1}}];\ny[{{2}, {0, 0}}] = Simplify[tS[{2, 0}][θ[1]] . Inverse[t[{1, 0}][θ[1]]] . y[{{1}, {0, 0}}]];\ny[{{1}, {1, 0}}] = tS[{1, 0}][θ[1]] . y[{{1}, {0, 0}}];\ny[{{2}, {1, 0}}] = tS[{1, 0}][θ[1]] . y[{{2}, {0, 0}}];\ny[{{2}, {2, 0}}] = tS[{2, 0}][θ[1]] . y[{{2}, {0, 0}}];\ny[{{1}, {1, 1}}] = tS[{1, 1}][θ[1]] . y[{{1}, {0, 0}}];\ny[{{2}, {1, 1}}] = tS[{1, 1}][θ[1]] . y[{{2}, {0, 0}}];\ny[{{2}, {2, 1}}] = tS[{2, 1}][θ[1]] . y[{{2}, {0, 0}}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* check C(u)|y_μ⟩ = (u-θ+hμ11)(u-θ+hμ21)(u-θ+hμ22-h)|y_μ⟩; expect {0} *)\nUnion[Flatten[Simplify[Table[Cc[u] . y[μ] - y[μ]*(u - θ[1] + h*μ[[1]][[1]])*(u - θ[1] + h*μ[[2]][[1]])*(u - θ[1] + h*μ[[2]][[2]] - h), {μ, gtpats}]]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"1\" data-out-n=\"58\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"17\" data-sub-start=\"1\" data-sub-end=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[58]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezBccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
