  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Twisted w-vacuum rotated to the z-diagonal frame",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "τvac[u_] = Sum[z[j]*ν[j][u], {j, 3}];\n(* companion-twist vacuum covector *)\nΩL[z_] = {{1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}} . MatrixExp[(1/z[1])*Ee[1][1, 2]] . MatrixExp[(-(1/(z[1]*z[2])))*Ee[1][1, 3]] . MatrixExp[((z[1] + z[2])/(z[1]*z[2]))*Ee[1][2, 3]];\nee[i_, j_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, ii]*KroneckerDelta[j, jj], {ii, 3}, {jj, 3}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* physical-space Gauss factors (upper, lower, diagonal) *)\nPpp = MatrixExp[(1/z[1])*Ee[1][1, 2]] . MatrixExp[(-(1/(z[1]*z[2])))*Ee[1][1, 3]] . MatrixExp[((z[1] + z[2])/(z[1]*z[2]))*Ee[1][2, 3]];\nPmp = MatrixExp[r[1]*Ee[1][3, 2]] . MatrixExp[r[2]*Ee[1][3, 1]] . MatrixExp[r[3]*Ee[1][2, 1]];\nPdp = MatrixExp[Log[s[1]]*Ee[1][1, 1]] . MatrixExp[Log[s[2]]*Ee[1][2, 2]] . MatrixExp[Log[s[3]]*Ee[1][3, 3]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "LL = Sum[KroneckerProduct[ee[i, j], ℒ[1][i, j][u]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\ncomm[aa_, bb_] := aa . bb - bb . aa;\n(* gl(3) invariance of the Lax operator: aux e_ij compensated by -E_ji on physical space; expect {0} *)\nUnion[Flatten[Simplify[Table[comm[LL, KroneckerProduct[ee[i, j], IdentityMatrix[8]] + KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[3], -Ee[1][j, i]]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"3\" data-out-n=\"68\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"22\" data-sub-start=\"3\" data-sub-end=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[68]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezBccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
