  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* explicit monic solution q (degree d) of the mirror operator with Q = zz^(-x) q; returns its roots in x - θ *)\npolySol[op_, tt_, zz_, s_, d_] := Module[{c, q, eqs, ns},\n  q[y_] := Sum[c[j] y^j, {j, 0, d}];\n  eqs = CoefficientList[Expand[baxOp[op, tt, Function[y, zz^(s y) q[y]], X]/zz^(s X)], X];\n  ns = NullSpace[N[Table[Coefficient[e, c[j]], {e, eqs}, {j, 0, d}], precB], Tolerance -> 10^-30];\n  {Length[ns], If[Length[ns] > 0, Chop[X - θ[1] /. ptB /. NSolve[Sum[ns[[1, j + 1]] X^j, {j, 0, d}] == 0, X], 10^-20], {}]}];\nrootsB = Table[{Round[wtB[[A]]], Table[N[polySol[\"mirror\", eigvalB[[A]], z[i] /. ptB, -1, scanB[[A, 2, 2, 2, i]]], 8], {i, 3}]}, {A, 8}];\nToString[rootsB, InputForm]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
