  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* monic q of the given degree solving op with Q = zz^(s x) q, as a polynomial in X *)\nmonicQ[op_, tt_, zz_, s_, d_] := Module[{c, q, eqs, ns, p},\n  q[y_] := Sum[c[j] y^j, {j, 0, d}];\n  eqs = CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[baxOp[op, tt, Function[y, zz^(s y) q[y]], X]/zz^(s X)], 10^-40], X];\n  ns = If[eqs === {}, {UnitVector[d + 1, d + 1]}, NullSpace[N[Table[Coefficient[e, c[j]], {e, eqs}, {j, 0, d}], precB], Tolerance -> 10^-30]];\n  p = Sum[ns[[1, j + 1]] X^j, {j, 0, d}]; Expand[p/Coefficient[p, X, d]]];\nzB = Table[z[i] /. ptB, {i, 3}];\n(* QQ check: Q_ab(u) = Q_a(u)Q_b(u+h) - Q_b(u)Q_a(u+h).  With z1 z2 z3 = 1 the exponentials match z_c^(u/h), so test\n   q_a(X) q_b(X+1)/z_b - q_b(X) q_a(X+1)/z_a  ==  C * F(X) * q^c(X),  F = ν1(X) = X-θ+2h (mirror of the old F_λ).\n   Returns {max residual, C, C/(1/z_b - 1/z_a)} per (a,b,c). *)\nqqB = Table[Module[{tt = eigvalB[[A]], qd, qu, w, f, cc},\n   qd = Table[monicQ[\"mirror\", tt, zB[[i]], -1, scanB[[A, 2, 2, 2, i]]], {i, 3}];\n   qu = Table[monicQ[\"dualMirror\", tt, zB[[j]], 1, scanDualB[[A, 2, 2, 1, j]]], {j, 3}];\n   {Round[wtB[[A]]], Table[{a, b, c} = abc;\n     w = Expand[qd[[a]] (qd[[b]] /. X -> X + 1)/zB[[b]] - qd[[b]] (qd[[a]] /. X -> X + 1)/zB[[a]]];\n     f = Expand[ν1B[X] qu[[c]]];\n     cc = Coefficient[w, X, Exponent[f, X]];\n     N[{Max[Abs[CoefficientList[w - cc f, X]]], cc, cc/(1/zB[[b]] - 1/zB[[a]])}, 6], {abc, {{1, 2, 3}, {2, 3, 1}, {3, 1, 2}}}]}], {A, 8}];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[Flatten[{Row[r[[1]], \",\"], Map[Row[Chop[#, 10^-20], \" | \"] &, r[[2]]]}], {r, qqB}], {\"weight μ\", \"(1,2;3) resid | C | C/(1/z2-1/z1)\", \"(2,3;1)\", \"(3,1;2)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
