  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* check 2: P_λ = T_λ D_{0,-1,-2} / D_{λ1,λ2-1,λ3-2} for every λ in a 3x3 box: remainder, state-independence, roots in x-θ, vs content-product guess *)\nlamList = Select[Tuples[Range[0, 3], 3], #[[1]] >= #[[2]] >= #[[3]] && Total[#] > 0 &];\ncontentP[lam_, x_] := Product[ν[3][x + (c - r) h] /. ptB, {r, 3}, {c, lam[[r]]}];\ncbrWr = Table[Module[{res},\n    res = Table[Module[{qu, d0, dl, quo, rem},\n       qu = Table[monicQ[\"dualMirror\", eigvalB[[A]], zB[[j]], 1, scanDualB[[A, 2, 2, 1, j]]], {j, 3}];\n       d0 = casD[qu, {0, -1, -2}]; dl = casD[qu, lam - {0, 1, 2}];\n       {quo, rem} = PolynomialQuotientRemainder[Expand[cbrT[eigvalB[[A]], lam, X] d0], dl, X];\n       {Max[Abs[CoefficientList[Chop[rem, 10^-30], X]], 0], Chop[quo, 10^-30]}], {A, 8}];\n    {lam, N[Max[res[[All, 1]]], 3],\n     N[Max[Table[Max[Abs[CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[res[[A, 2]] - res[[1, 2]]], 10^-30], X]], 0], {A, 8}]], 3],\n     Sort[Chop[N[X - θ[1] /. ptB /. NSolve[res[[1, 2]] == 0, X], 6], 10^-10]],\n     N[Max[Abs[CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[res[[1, 2]] - contentP[lam, X]], 10^-30], X]], 0], 3]}], {lam, lamList}];\nGrid[Prepend[cbrWr, {\"λ\", \"max remainder\", \"state spread of P\", \"roots of P in x-θ\", \"P - content product\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
