   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Status (adjoint, $\\chi_3=7/2$).**\n- **What works.** With the normalizations above, $\\langle\\Psi_A|\\Psi_B\\rangle$ is exactly diagonal and $\\det N^{AB}$ is diagonal to about $10^{-55}$.\n- **What fails.** The mirrored reference factors do not make $R_A=\\langle\\Psi_A|\\Psi_A\\rangle/\\det N^{AA}$ times $c^{\\rm ref}_A\\Psi^{\\rm ref}_A$ state-independent; it still varies by a factor of about 15.\n- **A clue.** The product is a simple rational for the six weight-$S_3(2,1,0)$ states (for example $-40/343$, $-64/675$, $-1000/567$) but irrational for the two $(1,1,1)$ states. So the mirrored factors absorb most of the irrational dependence, but not the right reference points or normalization for this gauge.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### SoV wavefunction from the construction of $\\langle x_\\mu|$\nEvery $\\langle x_\\mu|$ is $\\langle x_{\\{2\\},\\{2,1\\}}|$ times $t$'s at $\\theta-2h$, so with $\\langle x_{\\{2\\},\\{2,1\\}}|\\Psi\\rangle=1$ each overlap $\\langle x_\\mu|\\Psi\\rangle$ is a product of eigenvalues $T_\\lambda(\\theta-2h)$. For example $\\langle x_{\\{2\\},\\{2,0\\}}|\\Psi\\rangle=T_{20}/T_{10}$.\n\nThe $2\\times2$ formula for $T_\\lambda(\\theta-2h)$, together with $v(\\theta)\\parallel v(\\theta-h)$, then predicts\n$$\\langle x_\\mu|\\Psi\\rangle=N_\\mu\\,\\frac{\\det_2[Q(x_{21}),Q(x_1)]\\,Q^k(x_{22})}{\\det_2[Q(\\theta-2h),Q(\\theta-3h)]\\,Q^k(\\theta-h)}.$$\nHere $x_1=\\theta-(\\mu_{11}+1)h$, $x_{21}=\\theta-\\mu_{21}h$ and $x_{22}=\\theta-\\mu_{22}h$ are the B-roots of $\\langle x_\\mu|$, the $Q$'s are dual ($Q^j$), and $N_\\mu$ is state-independent. The prediction is the same for any choice of the two rows and of $k$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "TLm2[A_, lam_] := cbrT[eigvalB[[A]], lam, x0B];\n(* the overlaps implied by the definitions of x[μ] (cell 13), all T at θ-2h *)\npredX[A_, μ_] := With[{T = TLm2[A, #] &}, Switch[μ,\n    {{2}, {2, 1}}, 1, {{2}, {1, 1}}, T[{1, 0}], {{1}, {1, 1}}, T[{1, 1}], {{2}, {2, 0}}, T[{2, 0}]/T[{1, 0}],\n    {{2}, {1, 0}}, T[{2, 0}], {{2}, {0, 0}}, T[{2, 0}]^2/T[{1, 0}], {{1}, {1, 0}}, T[{2, 0}] T[{1, 1}]/T[{1, 0}], {{1}, {0, 0}}, T[{2, 0}] T[{2, 1}]/T[{1, 0}]]];\nxN[μ_] := xN[μ] = N[Flatten[x[μ] /. ptB], precB];\novX = Table[xN[μ] . ketN[[A]], {A, 8}, {μ, gtpats}];\ncheckX1 = N[Max[Abs[ovX - Table[predX[A, μ], {A, 8}, {μ, gtpats}]]], 3];\n(* Q form: rows {a,b} of the 2x2, component k for the x22 factor *)\npsiQx[A_, μ_, {a_, b_}, k_] := With[{m1 = -(μ[[1, 1]] + 1), m21 = -μ[[2, 1]], m22 = -μ[[2, 2]]},\n   (colB[A, m21][[a]] colB[A, m1][[b]] - colB[A, m21][[b]] colB[A, m1][[a]]) colB[A, m22][[k]]];\nNmuX[rows_, k_] := Table[ovX[[A, M]] psiQx[A, gtpats[[1]], rows, k]/psiQx[A, gtpats[[M]], rows, k], {A, 8}, {M, 8}];\nspreadX = Table[N[Max[Table[Max[Abs[#[[All, M]]/#[[1, M]] - 1]] &[NmuX[rows, k]], {M, 8}]], 3], {rows, {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}}}, {k, 3}];\nNmuXvals = Rationalize[Chop[NmuX[{1, 2}, 1][[1]], 10^-40], 10^-30];\nToString[{\"<x_mu|Psi> = T(theta-2h) products:\", checkX1, \"N_mu state-spread per (rows,k):\", spreadX, \"N_mu:\", Thread[gtpats -> NmuXvals]}, InputForm]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"117\" data-out-n=\"813\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"57\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[813]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"wolfbook-render-error\" style=\"color:#cc0000;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">[LaTeX error] KaTeX parse error: Expected &#39;}&#39;, got &#39;_&#39; at position 13: \\text{&quot;{\\&quot;&lt;x_̲mu|Psi&gt; = T(the…<br><small>\\text{&quot;{\\&quot;&lt;x_mu|Psi&gt; = T(theta-2h) products:\\&quot;, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$55.84800757279931, \\&quot;N_mu state-spread per (rows,k):\\&quot;, {{0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$51.12662171565074, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$51.12661622832889, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$51.126615871086024}, {0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.562206427713285, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.55273419197532, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.64805553033493}, {0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.51213470641845, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.503683994537646, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.58776824750796}}, \\&quot;N_mu:\\&quot;, {{{2}, {2, 1}} -&gt; 1, {{2}, {1, 1}} -&gt; -2, {{1}, {1, 1}} -&gt; 6, {{2}, {2, 0}} -&gt; -1, {{2}, {1, 0}} -&gt; 2, {{2}, {0, 0}} -&gt; -2, {{1}, {1, 0}} -&gt; -6, {{1}, {0, 0}} -&gt; 6}}&quot;}</small></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[813]= \\text{\"{\\\"<x_mu|Psi> = T(theta-2h) products:\\\", 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$55.84800757279931, \\\"N_mu state-spread per (rows,k):\\\", {{0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$51.12662171565074, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$51.12661622832889, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$51.126615871086024}, {0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.562206427713285, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.55273419197532, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.64805553033493}, {0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.51213470641845, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.503683994537646, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.58776824750796}}, \\\"N_mu:\\\", {{{2}, {2, 1}} -> 1, {{2}, {1, 1}} -> -2, {{1}, {1, 1}} -> 6, {{2}, {2, 0}} -> -1, {{2}, {1, 0}} -> 2, {{2}, {0, 0}} -> -2, {{1}, {1, 0}} -> -6, {{1}, {0, 0}} -> 6}}\"}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "6a42e39e-afd8-4847-aff8-ee79ac8eff73"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "toolId": "Y111sZmlsZQ"
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (x side).** $\\langle x_\\mu|\\Psi\\rangle$ equals the $T(\\theta-2h)$ products exactly for all 8 $\\mu$ and all 8 states. The $Q$ form holds with a state-independent $N_\\mu$ for every choice of rows and $k$. At $h=1$ in `gtpats` order, $N_\\mu=(1,-2,6,-1,2,-2,-6,6)$.\n\n### The y side\nThe $|y_\\mu\\rangle$ are built from $|y_{\\{1\\},\\{0,0\\}}\\rangle$ by the `tS` matrices at $\\theta$, and the C-roots of $|y_\\mu\\rangle$ are $y_1=\\theta-\\mu_{11}h$, $y_{21}=\\theta-\\mu_{21}h$ and $y_{22}=\\theta-(\\mu_{22}-1)h$. I expect the direct columns $u(p)=(Q_1,Q_2,Q_3)(p)$ to play the role $v$ played on the x side. The cell scans them for degeneracies, then tests $\\langle\\Psi|y_\\mu\\rangle/\\langle\\Psi|y_{\\rm low}\\rangle=N'_\\mu\\,\\Phi(\\mu)/\\Phi(\\text{low})$ with $\\Phi=\\det_2[u(p),u(q)]\\,u_k(r)$ for the three assignments of $\\{y_1,y_{21},y_{22}\\}$ to the slots.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "yN[μ_] := yN[μ] = N[Flatten[y[μ] /. ptB], precB];\nyLow = {{1}, {0, 0}};\novY = Table[braN[[A]] . yN[μ], {A, 8}, {μ, gtpats}];\novYr = Table[ovY[[A, M]]/(braN[[A]] . yN[yLow]), {A, 8}, {M, 8}];\n(* direct column at p = θ + m h, row prefactor z_i^(-θ/h) stripped: z_i^(-m) q_i(θ+m) *)\ncolD[A_, m_] := Table[zB[[i]]^(-m) (qdB[[A, i]] /. X -> thN + m), {i, 3}];\ndegD = Table[{Select[Subsets[mRange, {2}], Norm[Flatten[Minors[Transpose[{colD[A, #[[1]]], colD[A, #[[2]]]}], 2]]] < 10^-30 &],\n    Select[Subsets[mRange, {3}], Abs[Det[colD[A, #] & /@ #]] < 10^-30 &]}, {A, 8}];\ndegDCommon = Table[Intersection @@ degD[[All, k]], {k, 2}];\nyRoots[μ_] := {-μ[[1, 1]], -μ[[2, 1]], -(μ[[2, 2]] - 1)};\nphiQ[A_, μ_, perm_, {a_, b_}, k_] := With[{r = yRoots[μ][[perm]]}, (colD[A, r[[1]]][[a]] colD[A, r[[2]]][[b]] - colD[A, r[[1]]][[b]] colD[A, r[[2]]][[a]]) colD[A, r[[3]]][[k]]];\n(* state spread of N'_μ for each slot assignment (det slots p,q ; single slot r) and rows/k choice *)\nNmuY[perm_, rows_, k_] := Table[With[{den = phiQ[A, gtpats[[M]], perm, rows, k]}, If[Abs[den] < 10^-40, Indeterminate, ovYr[[A, M]] phiQ[A, yLow, perm, rows, k]/den]], {A, 8}, {M, 8}];\nspreadY = Table[{perm, Table[With[{nm = NmuY[perm, rows, k]}, If[FreeQ[nm, Indeterminate], N[Max[Table[Max[Abs[nm[[All, M]]/nm[[1, M]] - 1]], {M, 8}]], 3], \"singular\"]], {rows, {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}}}, {k, 3}]}, {perm, {{1, 2, 3}, {2, 3, 1}, {1, 3, 2}}}];\nToString[{\"direct parallel pairs:\", degDCommon[[1]], \"direct dependent triples:\", degDCommon[[2]], \"N'_mu spreads (perm -> rows x k):\", spreadY}, InputForm]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"118\" data-out-n=\"825\" data-sub-idx=\"13\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"59\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[825]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"wolfbook-render-error\" style=\"color:#cc0000;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">[LaTeX error] KaTeX parse error: Expected &#39;}&#39;, got &#39;_&#39; at position 231: …1, 0, 1}}, \\&quot;N&#39;_̲mu spreads (per…<br><small>\\text{&quot;{\\&quot;direct parallel pairs:\\&quot;, {{-2, -1}}, \\&quot;direct dependent triples:\\&quot;, {{-6, -2, -1}, {-5, -2, -1}, {-4, -2, -1}, {-3, -2, -1}, {-2, -1, 0}, {-2, -1, 1}, {-2, -1, 2}, {-2, -1, 3}, {-2, -1, 4}, {-2, 0, 1}, {-1, 0, 1}}, \\&quot;N&#39;_mu spreads (perm -&gt; rows x k):\\&quot;, {{{1, 2, 3}, {{\\&quot;singular\\&quot;, \\&quot;singular\\&quot;, \\&quot;singular\\&quot;}, {\\&quot;singular\\&quot;, \\&quot;singular\\&quot;, \\&quot;singular\\&quot;}, {\\&quot;singular\\&quot;, \\&quot;singular\\&quot;, \\&quot;singular\\&quot;}}}, {{2, 3, 1}, {{0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$51.129303095260376, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$51.129307924829554, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$51.12929938179346}, {0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.708610183667346, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.730135591773454, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.811598277254255}, {0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.69977253285597, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.7208536396703, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.800425709665625}}}, {{1, 3, 2}, {{0.6175247790193740035$\\grave{ }$3., 0.7093824490825962865$\\grave{ }$3., 1.371928518242740134$\\grave{ }$3.}, {0.6175247790193740035$\\grave{ }$3., 0.7093824490825962865$\\grave{ }$3., 1.371928518242740134$\\grave{ }$3.}, {0.6175247790193740035$\\grave{ }$3., 0.7093824490825962865$\\grave{ }$3., 1.371928518242740134$\\grave{ }$3.}}}}}&quot;}</small></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
