     ],
     "id": "b880ccec-39b5-4342-9687-97bca2b0ace0"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "toolId": "Y113sZmlsZQ"
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (y side).** The direct columns satisfy $u(\\theta-2h)\\parallel u(\\theta-h)$, and $u(\\theta-2h),\\dots,u(\\theta+h)$ lie in one 2-plane. The wavefunction is\n$$\\frac{\\langle\\Psi|y_\\mu\\rangle}{\\langle\\Psi|y_{\\rm low}\\rangle}=N'_\\mu\\,\\frac{\\det_2[u(y_{21}),u(y_{22})]\\,u_k(y_1)}{(\\text{same at low})},$$\nexact, with $N'_\\mu$ state-independent for every choice of rows and $k$. The other two root assignments fail.\n\n### Norm test\nThe ket is normalized at $x_0$ and the bra at $y_0=y_{\\{2\\},\\{2,1\\}}$, so we expect $\\langle\\Psi|\\Psi\\rangle=\\kappa\\det N/(\\Psi_Q(x_0)\\Phi_Q(y_0))$ with\n- $\\Psi_Q(x_0)=\\det_2^{ab}[v(\\theta-2h),v(\\theta-3h)]\\,v_k(\\theta-h)$,\n- $\\Phi_Q(y_0)=\\det_2^{cd}[u(\\theta-2h),u(\\theta)]\\,u_l(\\theta-2h)$.\n\nThe choice of rows and of $k,l$ changes these by state-dependent factors, so the cell scans all $3\\cdot3\\cdot3\\cdot3$ combinations for a state-independent $\\kappa$. $\\det N$ uses the rows $\\{(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)\\}$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "rowPairs = {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}};\npsiQx0[A_, {a_, b_}, k_] := (colB[A, -2][[a]] colB[A, -3][[b]] - colB[A, -2][[b]] colB[A, -3][[a]]) colB[A, -1][[k]];\nphiQy0[A_, {c_, d_}, l_] := (colD[A, -2][[c]] colD[A, 0][[d]] - colD[A, -2][[d]] colD[A, 0][[c]]) colD[A, -2][[l]];\nnormScan = Flatten[Table[With[{kap = Table[ratioN[[A]] psiQx0[A, ab, k] phiQy0[A, cd, l], {A, 8}]},\n      {ab, k, cd, l, N[Max[Abs[kap/kap[[1]] - 1]], 3], kap[[1]]}], {ab, rowPairs}, {k, 3}, {cd, rowPairs}, {l, 3}], 3];\nnormGood = Select[normScan, #[[5]] < 10^-30 &];\nToString[{\"# combos:\", Length[normScan], \"# with state-independent kappa:\", Length[normGood], \"best spreads:\", Take[Sort[normScan[[All, 5]]], 5], \"good:\", Table[{g[[1]], g[[2]], g[[3]], g[[4]], Rationalize[Chop[g[[6]], 10^-40], 10^-30]}, {g, normGood}]}, InputForm]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"119\" data-out-n=\"831\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"61\" data-sub-start=\"6\" data-sub-end=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[831]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"wolfbook-render-error\" style=\"color:#cc0000;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">[LaTeX error] KaTeX parse error: Expected group as argument to &#39;\\&quot;&#39; at position 11: \\text{&quot;{\\&quot;#̲ combos:\\&quot;, 81,…<br><small>\\text{&quot;{\\&quot;# combos:\\&quot;, 81, \\&quot;# with state-independent kappa:\\&quot;, 1, \\&quot;best spreads:\\&quot;, {0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$51.16668425138278, 0.9999998503585781428$\\grave{ }$3., 1.0146505143433261393$\\grave{ }$3., 1.0146505143433261393$\\grave{ }$3., 1.0243597406376508654$\\grave{ }$3.}, \\&quot;good:\\&quot;, {{{2, 3}, 3, {1, 2}, 1, 283036893821043/245942204792371}}}&quot;}</small></span></div></div></div>",
