       "data": "Out[831]= \\text{\"{\\\"# combos:\\\", 81, \\\"# with state-independent kappa:\\\", 1, \\\"best spreads:\\\", {0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$51.16668425138278, 0.9999998503585781428$\\grave{ }$3., 1.0146505143433261393$\\grave{ }$3., 1.0146505143433261393$\\grave{ }$3., 1.0243597406376508654$\\grave{ }$3.}, \\\"good:\\\", {{{2, 3}, 3, {1, 2}, 1, 283036893821043/245942204792371}}}\"}",
