  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result: norm formula (adjoint, L=1).** Of the 81 choices, exactly one gives a state-independent $\\kappa$, and it is the same one at both numeric points ($\\chi_3=7/2$ and $\\chi_3=1$):\n$$\\langle\\Psi_A|\\Psi_A\\rangle=\\frac{\\kappa\\,\\det N^{AA}}{\\Psi_Q(x_0)\\,\\Phi_Q(y_0)}.$$\n- **Ket factor (dual Q's).** $\\Psi_Q(x_0)=\\big[Q^2(\\theta-2h)Q^3(\\theta-3h)-Q^3(\\theta-2h)Q^2(\\theta-3h)\\big]\\,Q^3(\\theta-h)$.\n- **Bra factor (direct Q's).** $\\Phi_Q(y_0)=\\big[Q_1(\\theta-2h)Q_2(\\theta)-Q_2(\\theta-2h)Q_1(\\theta)\\big]\\,Q_1(\\theta-2h)$.\n- **Normalizations.** $\\langle x_{\\{2\\},\\{2,1\\}}|\\Psi\\rangle=1$ and $\\langle\\Psi|y_{\\{2\\},\\{2,1\\}}\\rangle=1$; $\\det N$ uses the rows $\\{(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)\\}$.\n\nThese factors are the SoV wavefunctions at $x_0$ (B-roots $\\theta-3h,\\theta-2h,\\theta-h$) and $y_0$ (C-roots $\\theta-2h,\\theta-2h,\\theta$), in the forms found above.\n\n$\\kappa$ is fixed analytically in the cells below. (An earlier version of this note reported a spurious $z_3^{2\\theta/h}$ dependence of $\\kappa$. That came from a wrong factor when restoring the stripped $z^{\\theta/h}$ row prefactors; with the full $Q$'s, $\\kappa=4/9$ at both points.)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Normalizing $\\det N$ by its $(x_0,y_0)$ coefficient\nTreat the $Q$'s as independent symbols: `Qu[j][m]` $=Q^j(\\theta+mh)$ and `Qd[i][m]` $=Q_i(\\theta+mh)$. Expanding $\\det N$ then gives a sum of monomials in $Q$'s at shifted points. The $(x_0,y_0)$ term is $\\Psi_Q(x_0)\\Phi_Q(y_0)$, which is four monomials. If their coefficients are $\\pm c_0$, consistently, the prediction is $\\langle\\Psi|\\Psi\\rangle=\\det N/(c_0\\Psi_Q(x_0)\\Phi_Q(y_0))$, i.e. $\\kappa=1/c_0$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Qu, Qd];\n(* poles θ-nh, n = λ3..λ1 = 0..2 for the adjoint; weights with symbolic h *)\nwS[n_] := 1/Product[(m - n) h, {m, DeleteCases[{0, 1, 2}, n]}];\nrowS[{i_, j_}] := Sum[wS[n] {-Qu[j][-n] Qd[i][-n], Qu[j][-n] Qd[i][-n + 1], Qu[j][-n - 1] Qd[i][-n]}, {n, 0, 2}];\ndetS = Expand[Det[rowS /@ {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}}]];\npsiS = (Qu[2][-2] Qu[3][-3] - Qu[3][-2] Qu[2][-3]) Qu[3][-1];\nphiS = (Qd[1][-2] Qd[2][0] - Qd[2][-2] Qd[1][0]) Qd[1][-2];\ntargetMon = MonomialList[Expand[psiS phiS]];\n(* coefficient of each target monomial in det N, divided by its coefficient in psiS phiS *)\nc0List = Table[Coefficient[detS, mon/(mon /. (Qu | Qd)[_][_] -> 1)]/(mon /. (Qu | Qd)[_][_] -> 1), {mon, targetMon}];\nc0S = Simplify[c0List[[1]]];\nToString[{\"# monomials in det N:\", Length[MonomialList[detS]], \"target coefficient ratios (should all agree):\", Simplify[c0List], \"c0:\", c0S}, InputForm]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"120\" data-out-n=\"841\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"64\" data-sub-start=\"11\" data-sub-end=\"11\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[841]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7XHtcXCMgbW9ub21pYWxzIGluIGRldCBOOlwsIDEsICBhcmdldCBjb2VmZmljaWVudCByYXRpb3MgKHNob3VsZCBhbGwgYWdyZWUpOlwsIFx7MS8oNCpoXF57fTYpLCAxLyg0KmhcXnt9NiksIDEvKDQqaFxee302KSwgMS8oNCpoXF57fTYpXH0sIFxjMDpcLCAxLyg0KmhcXnt9NilcfX0=\"><span class=\"wolfbook-render-error\" style=\"color:#cc0000;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">[LaTeX error] KaTeX parse error: Expected &#39;EOF&#39;, got &#39;#&#39; at position 11: \\text{\\{\\\\#̲ monomials in d…<br><small>\\text{\\{\\\\# monomials in det N:\\, 1,  arget coefficient ratios (should all agree):\\, \\{1/(4*h\\^{}6), 1/(4*h\\^{}6), 1/(4*h\\^{}6), 1/(4*h\\^{}6)\\}, \\c0:\\, 1/(4*h\\^{}6)\\}}</small></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[841]= \\text{\\{\\\\# monomials in det N:\\, 1,  arget coefficient ratios (should all agree):\\, \\{1/(4*h\\^{}6), 1/(4*h\\^{}6), 1/(4*h\\^{}6), 1/(4*h\\^{}6)\\}, \\c0:\\, 1/(4*h\\^{}6)\\}}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "030c1f8a-0b59-4640-8b58-9d534a6036f0"
