     ],
     "id": "dc867996-7c40-4d3c-8c0b-8531237b3b71"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result: normalized norm formula.** Expanding $\\det N$ with the $Q$'s as independent symbols, the four monomials of $\\Psi_Q(x_0)\\Phi_Q(y_0)$ all appear with the same coefficient, $c_0=1/(4h^6)$. With full $Q$'s (monic, exponentials $z^{\\pm u/h}$ kept), at both numeric points and for all 8 states:\n$$\\langle\\Psi_A|\\Psi_A\\rangle=\\frac{1}{\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle}\\cdot\\frac{\\det N^{AA}/c_0}{\\Psi_Q(x_0)\\,\\Phi_Q(y_0)},\\qquad \\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle=9h^4,$$\ni.e. $\\kappa=1/(c_0\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle)=4/9$ at $h=1$.\n\nSo once $\\det N$ is divided by its $(x_0,y_0)$ coefficient and by the reference wavefunctions, the only constant left is $1/\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle$. This is the $(y_0,x_0)$ entry of the inverse of the $\\langle x|y\\rangle$ matrix, which is triangular and has no off-diagonal entries involving $x_0$ or $y_0$. That entry is expected from normalizing the bra at $y_0$ and the ket at $x_0$.\n\nThe $h$ dependence ($\\kappa=4h^2/9$) follows from the symbolic $c_0$ and $\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle$ but is not tested numerically, since both points have $h=1$. The notebook is at `ptSel = 2`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Check at $h\\neq1$\nThis cell is self-contained, with all shifts in units of $h$ and exponentials $z^{\\pm x/h}$. The point is $h=1/2$, $\\theta=2/7$, $z=(3/2,5/4,2/3)$, so $\\chi_3=5/4$. The prediction is $\\kappa=1/(c_0\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle)=4h^2/9=1/9$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Module[{pH = {h -> 1/2, θ[1] -> 2/7, z[1] -> 3/2, z[2] -> 5/4, z[3] -> 2/3}, prec = 60, hH, thH, zH, tGh, mix, evR, vecR, evL, vecL, vals, nu1, nu3, opD, opU, solve, qd, qu, QD, QU, w, row, detN, kets, bras, gram, x0, y0, psiQ, phiQ, kap, pred},\n  hH = h /. pH; thH = θ[1] /. pH; zH = Table[z[i] /. pH, {i, 3}];\n  tGh = Table[Expand[tG[a][u] /. pH], {a, 3}];\n  mix = N[(tGh[[1]] + Pi tGh[[2]]) /. u -> 3/7, prec];\n  {evR, vecR} = Eigensystem[mix]; {evL, vecL} = Eigensystem[Transpose[mix]];\n  vals = Table[With[{k = Ordering[Abs[ψ], -1][[1]]}, Table[Chop[Expand[(N[tGh[[a]], prec] . ψ)[[k]]/ψ[[k]]], 10^-40], {a, 3}]], {ψ, vecR}];\n  nu1[x_] := ν[1][x] /. pH; nu3[x_] := ν[3][x] /. pH;\n  (* mirror-form direct (on Q_i) and dual (on Q^j) operators, shifts in units of h *)\n  opD[tt_, Q_, x_] := nu1[x] nu1[x + hH] nu1[x + 2 hH] Q[x - hH] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x) nu1[x + hH] nu1[x + 2 hH] Q[x] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x + hH) nu1[x + 2 hH] Q[x + hH] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x + 2 hH) Q[x + 2 hH];\n  opU[tt_, Q_, x_] := nu3[x - hH] nu3[x - 2 hH] nu3[x - 3 hH] Q[x] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x - hH) nu3[x - 2 hH] nu3[x - 3 hH] Q[x - hH] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x - hH) nu3[x - 3 hH] Q[x - 2 hH] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x - hH) Q[x - 3 hH];\n  (* minimal-degree monic q with Q = zz^(s x/h) q; Q(X+kh)/zz^(sX/h) = zz^(s k) q(X+kh) *)\n  solve[op_, tt_, zz_, s_] := Module[{c, eqs, ns, res = {}},\n    Do[If[res === {},\n      eqs = CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[op[tt, Function[y, zz^(s (y - X)/hH) Sum[c[j] y^j, {j, 0, d}]], X]], 10^-40], X];\n      ns = If[eqs === {}, {UnitVector[d + 1, d + 1]}, NullSpace[N[Table[Coefficient[e, c[j]], {e, eqs}, {j, 0, d}], prec], Tolerance -> 10^-30]];\n      If[Length[ns] > 0, res = Expand[#/Coefficient[#, X, d]] &[Sum[ns[[1, j + 1]] X^j, {j, 0, d}]]]], {d, 0, 4}]; res];\n  qd = Table[solve[opD, tt, zH[[i]], -1], {tt, vals}, {i, 3}];\n  qu = Table[solve[opU, tt, zH[[j]], 1], {tt, vals}, {j, 3}];\n  QD[A_, i_, x_] := N[zH[[i]]^(-x/hH), prec] (qd[[A, i]] /. X -> x);\n  QU[A_, j_, x_] := N[zH[[j]]^(x/hH), prec] (qu[[A, j]] /. X -> x);\n  w[n_] := 1/Product[(m - n) hH, {m, DeleteCases[{0, 1, 2}, n]}];\n  row[A_, B_, {i_, j_}] := Sum[With[{x = thH - n hH}, w[n] {-QU[A, j, x] QD[B, i, x], QU[A, j, x] QD[B, i, x + hH], QU[A, j, x - hH] QD[B, i, x]}], {n, 0, 2}];\n  detN = Table[Det[row[A, B, #] & /@ {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}}], {A, 8}, {B, 8}];\n  x0 = N[Flatten[x[{{2}, {2, 1}}] /. pH], prec]; y0 = N[Flatten[y[{{2}, {2, 1}}] /. pH], prec];\n  kets = Table[v/(x0 . v), {v, vecR}];\n  bras = Table[With[{wv = vecL[[First[Ordering[Abs[evL - evR[[A]]], 1]]]]}, wv/(wv . y0)], {A, 8}];\n  gram = Table[bras[[A]] . kets[[B]], {A, 8}, {B, 8}];\n  psiQ[A_] := (QU[A, 2, thH - 2 hH] QU[A, 3, thH - 3 hH] - QU[A, 3, thH - 2 hH] QU[A, 2, thH - 3 hH]) QU[A, 3, thH - hH];\n  phiQ[A_] := (QD[A, 1, thH - 2 hH] QD[A, 2, thH] - QD[A, 2, thH - 2 hH] QD[A, 1, thH]) QD[A, 1, thH - 2 hH];\n  kap = Table[gram[[A, A]] psiQ[A] phiQ[A]/detN[[A, A]], {A, 8}];\n  pred = 1/((c0S x0y0) /. pH);\n  hCheck = {\"all Q's found\" -> FreeQ[{qd, qu}, {}], \"gram offdiag/diag\" -> offR[gram], \"detN offdiag/diag\" -> offR[detN], \"kappa spread\" -> N[Max[Abs[kap/kap[[1]] - 1]], 3], \"kappa\" -> N[kap[[1]], 15], \"prediction 4h^2/9\" -> pred};\n  ToString[hCheck, InputForm]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"122\" data-out-n=\"848\" data-sub-idx=\"0\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"68\" data-sub-start=\"0\" data-sub-end=\"32\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[848]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1813em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">ll Q’s found</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-&gt; True, </span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">ram offdiag/diag</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-&gt; 0</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˋ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˋ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">54.38841442848205, </span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">etN offdiag/diag</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-&gt; 6.80164214854827</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˋ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">3.*</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∧</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-63, </span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">k</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">appa spread</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-&gt; 0</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˋ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˋ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">53.080701123628415, </span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">k</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">appa</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-&gt; 0.11111111111111111111111111111111111111</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˋ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">15., </span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">rediction 4h</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∧</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2/9</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-&gt; 1/9</span></span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[848]= \\text{\"{\\\"all Q's found\\\" -> True, \\\"gram offdiag/diag\\\" -> 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$54.38841442848205, \\\"detN offdiag/diag\\\" -> 6.80164214854827$\\grave{ }$3.*${}^{\\wedge}$-63, \\\"kappa spread\\\" -> 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$53.080701123628415, \\\"kappa\\\" -> 0.11111111111111111111111111111111111111$\\grave{ }$15., \\\"prediction 4h${}^{\\wedge}$2/9\\\" -> 1/9}\"}",
