  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result ($h=1/2$).** $\\kappa=1/9=4h^2/9$ exactly for all 8 states, with $\\langle\\Psi_A|\\Psi_B\\rangle$ and $\\det N^{AB}$ diagonal. So the normalized formula\n$$\\langle\\Psi_A|\\Psi_A\\rangle=\\frac{1}{\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle}\\cdot\\frac{\\det N^{AA}/c_0}{\\Psi_Q(x_0)\\Phi_Q(y_0)},\\qquad c_0=\\frac1{4h^6},\\quad\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle=9h^4,$$\nholds at three points: $(h,\\chi_3)=(1,1),(1,7/2),(1/2,5/4)$.\n\n**Housekeeping (2026-10-01).** Several code cells inserted earlier had landed after their result notes, so the earlier range reruns had skipped some checks. The cells have been moved into order, and cells 33–69 were rerun cleanly at both $h=1$ points. Every check above passes at both, including the 81-combination scan, which picks the same unique combination. The notebook is left at `ptSel = 2`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Scalar product between different twists\n- **States.** $\\langle\\Psi_{A,w}|$ is a left eigenvector of $t^G(w)$, normalized by $\\langle\\Psi|y_0\\rangle=1$. $|\\Psi_{B,z}\\rangle$ is a right eigenvector of $t^G(z)$, normalized by $\\langle x_0|\\Psi\\rangle=1$. Both use the companion frame. $x_0=e_1$ is a B-eigencovector, and B is untwisted; $y_0$ is a C-eigenvector fixed by $\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle=9h^4$. So both should be twist-independent, which is checked below.\n- **Prediction.** The same formula, with each state's own twisted $Q$'s:\n$$\\langle\\Psi_{A,w}|\\Psi_{B,z}\\rangle=\\frac{\\det N[\\text{dual }Q^{B,z},\\ \\text{direct }Q_{A,w}]}{c_0\\,\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle\\,\\Psi_Q^{B,z}(x_0)\\,\\Phi_Q^{A,w}(y_0)}.$$\n  The ket factor uses the ket's dual $Q$'s and the bra factor the bra's direct $Q$'s. The SoV expansion $\\sum\\langle\\Psi_A|y\\rangle M_{yx}\\langle x|\\Psi_B\\rangle$ then says $\\det N$ should pair the bra's direct $Q$'s with the ket's dual $Q$'s. The other orientation is tested as a control.\n\nThe point is $h=1/2$, $\\theta=2/7$, with ket twist $z=(3/2,5/4,2/3)$ and bra twist $w=(5/2,7/3,3/5)$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Module[{hT = 1/2, thT = 2/7, zT = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, wT = {5/2, 7/3, 3/5}, prec = 60, ptOf, side, kS, bS, y0z, y0w, x0, kets, bras, gram, w, rowM, detMix, psiQ, phiQ, pred1, pred2, nu1, nu3},\n  ptOf[tw_] := {h -> hT, θ[1] -> thT, z[1] -> tw[[1]], z[2] -> tw[[2]], z[3] -> tw[[3]]};\n  nu1[x_] := ν[1][x] /. h -> hT /. θ[1] -> thT; nu3[x_] := ν[3][x] /. h -> hT /. θ[1] -> thT;\n  (* one twist: eigen-decomposition, eigenvalues, monic direct and dual Q's; returns an association *)\n  side[tw_] := Module[{pt = ptOf[tw], tGh, mix, evR, vecR, evL, vecL, vals, opD, opU, solve, qd, qu},\n    tGh = Table[Expand[tG[a][u] /. pt], {a, 3}];\n    mix = N[(tGh[[1]] + Pi tGh[[2]]) /. u -> 3/7, prec];\n    {evR, vecR} = Eigensystem[mix]; {evL, vecL} = Eigensystem[Transpose[mix]];\n    vals = Table[With[{k = Ordering[Abs[ψ], -1][[1]]}, Table[Chop[Expand[(N[tGh[[a]], prec] . ψ)[[k]]/ψ[[k]]], 10^-40], {a, 3}]], {ψ, vecR}];\n    opD[tt_, Q_, x_] := nu1[x] nu1[x + hT] nu1[x + 2 hT] Q[x - hT] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x) nu1[x + hT] nu1[x + 2 hT] Q[x] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x + hT) nu1[x + 2 hT] Q[x + hT] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x + 2 hT) Q[x + 2 hT];\n    opU[tt_, Q_, x_] := nu3[x - hT] nu3[x - 2 hT] nu3[x - 3 hT] Q[x] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x - hT) nu3[x - 2 hT] nu3[x - 3 hT] Q[x - hT] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x - hT) nu3[x - 3 hT] Q[x - 2 hT] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x - hT) Q[x - 3 hT];\n    solve[op_, tt_, zz_, s_] := Module[{c, eqs, ns, res = {}},\n      Do[If[res === {},\n        eqs = CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[op[tt, Function[y, zz^(s (y - X)/hT) Sum[c[j] y^j, {j, 0, d}]], X]], 10^-40], X];\n        ns = If[eqs === {}, {UnitVector[d + 1, d + 1]}, NullSpace[N[Table[Coefficient[e, c[j]], {e, eqs}, {j, 0, d}], prec], Tolerance -> 10^-30]];\n        If[Length[ns] > 0, res = Expand[#/Coefficient[#, X, d]] &[Sum[ns[[1, j + 1]] X^j, {j, 0, d}]]]], {d, 0, 4}]; res];\n    qd = Table[solve[opD, tt, tw[[i]], -1], {tt, vals}, {i, 3}];\n    qu = Table[solve[opU, tt, tw[[j]], 1], {tt, vals}, {j, 3}];\n    <|\"tw\" -> tw, \"evR\" -> evR, \"vecR\" -> vecR, \"evL\" -> evL, \"vecL\" -> vecL, \"qd\" -> qd, \"qu\" -> qu,\n      \"QD\" -> Function[{A, i, x}, N[tw[[i]]^(-x/hT), prec] (qd[[A, i]] /. X -> x)], \"QU\" -> Function[{A, j, x}, N[tw[[j]]^(x/hT), prec] (qu[[A, j]] /. X -> x)]|>];\n  kS = side[zT]; bS = side[wT];\n  x0 = N[Flatten[x[{{2}, {2, 1}}] /. ptOf[zT]], prec];\n  y0z = N[Flatten[y[{{2}, {2, 1}}] /. ptOf[zT]], prec]; y0w = N[Flatten[y[{{2}, {2, 1}}] /. ptOf[wT]], prec];\n  kets = Table[v/(x0 . v), {v, kS[\"vecR\"]}];\n  (* bra A: left eigenvector of tG(w), matched to the w-ket ordering through the same eigenvalue *)\n  bras = Table[With[{wv = bS[\"vecL\"][[First[Ordering[Abs[bS[\"evL\"] - bS[\"evR\"][[A]]], 1]]]]}, wv/(wv . y0w)], {A, 8}];\n  gram = Table[bras[[A]] . kets[[B]], {A, 8}, {B, 8}];\n  w[n_] := 1/Product[(m - n) hT, {m, DeleteCases[{0, 1, 2}, n]}];\n  (* rows (i,j): sum_n w_n {-P_j Q_i, P_j Q_i^[2], P_j^[-2] Q_i} with P = dual of state Pst, Q = direct of state Qst *)\n  rowM[PS_, A_, QS_, B_, {i_, j_}] := Sum[With[{xx = thT - n hT}, w[n] {-PS[\"QU\"][A, j, xx] QS[\"QD\"][B, i, xx], PS[\"QU\"][A, j, xx] QS[\"QD\"][B, i, xx + hT], PS[\"QU\"][A, j, xx - hT] QS[\"QD\"][B, i, xx]}], {n, 0, 2}];\n  psiQ[S_, B_] := (S[\"QU\"][B, 2, thT - 2 hT] S[\"QU\"][B, 3, thT - 3 hT] - S[\"QU\"][B, 3, thT - 2 hT] S[\"QU\"][B, 2, thT - 3 hT]) S[\"QU\"][B, 3, thT - hT];\n  phiQ[S_, A_] := (S[\"QD\"][A, 1, thT - 2 hT] S[\"QD\"][A, 2, thT] - S[\"QD\"][A, 2, thT - 2 hT] S[\"QD\"][A, 1, thT]) S[\"QD\"][A, 1, thT - 2 hT];\n  (* orientation 1 (SoV-expansion): dual Q's of the ket (z), direct Q's of the bra (w) *)\n  pred1 = Table[Det[rowM[kS, B, bS, A, #] & /@ {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}}]/((c0S x0y0 /. h -> hT) psiQ[kS, B] phiQ[bS, A]), {A, 8}, {B, 8}];\n  (* orientation 2 (control): dual Q's of the bra (w), direct Q's of the ket (z) *)\n  pred2 = Table[Det[rowM[bS, A, kS, B, #] & /@ {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}}]/((c0S x0y0 /. h -> hT) psiQ[kS, B] phiQ[bS, A]), {A, 8}, {B, 8}];\n  mixCheck = {\"all Q's found\" -> FreeQ[{kS[\"qd\"], kS[\"qu\"], bS[\"qd\"], bS[\"qu\"]}, {}],\n    \"y0 twist-independent\" -> N[Max[Abs[y0z - y0w]], 3],\n    \"min |gram entry|\" -> N[Min[Abs[Flatten[gram]]], 3],\n    \"orientation 1: max |pred/gram - 1|\" -> N[Max[Abs[Flatten[pred1/gram - 1]]], 3],\n    \"orientation 2: max |pred/gram - 1|\" -> N[Max[Abs[Flatten[pred2/gram - 1]]], 3]};\n  ToString[mixCheck, InputForm]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {
    "toolId": "Y140sZmlsZQ"
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (mixed twists, $h=1/2$, $\\theta=2/7$, $z=(3/2,5/4,2/3)$, $w=(5/2,7/3,3/5)$).**\n- **Normalization vectors.** $y_0$ is twist-independent, as predicted ($y_0(z)-y_0(w)=0$), and $x_0=e_1$.\n- **The match.** All 64 entries of $\\langle\\Psi_{A,w}|\\Psi_{B,z}\\rangle$, none of them small (the smallest is $|\\cdot|\\approx0.017$), match\n$$\\langle\\Psi_{A,w}|\\Psi_{B,z}\\rangle=\\frac{\\det N\\big[Q^{j}_{B,z},\\,Q_{i,A,w}\\big]}{c_0\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle\\,\\Psi_Q^{B,z}(x_0)\\,\\Phi_Q^{A,w}(y_0)}$$\n  to about $10^{-51}$.\n- **The only change.** Each state carries its own twisted $Q$'s; the bracket, $c_0$, $\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle$ and the reference points are unchanged.\n- **Orientation.** In $\\det N$, the dual $Q$'s must be the ket's and the direct $Q$'s the bra's, as the SoV expansion $\\sum\\langle\\Psi_A|y\\rangle M_{yx}\\langle x|\\Psi_B\\rangle$ requires. The ket factor uses the ket's dual $Q$'s, and the bra factor the bra's direct $Q$'s. The other orientation fails, with errors of order 100. At equal twists the two orientations agree only on the diagonal; off it, both vanish.\n\n**Labelling.** The earlier cells' `detNN[A,B]` used the dual $Q$'s of $A$ and the direct $Q$'s of $B$. For a general scalar product the arguments should be read as (ket dual, bra direct).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Back to the diagonal frame: $\\Omega_{zw}\\cdot\\Psi$ as a determinant of $Q$'s\n- **Frame map for $z$.** $P_{\\rm phys}(z)\\,t^G(z)\\,P_{\\rm phys}^{-1}=\\sum_iz_i\\mathcal L_{ii}$, so $|\\Psi_{\\rm diag}\\rangle=P_{\\rm phys}|\\Psi_{\\rm comp}\\rangle$, with the companion ket normalized by $\\langle x_0|\\Psi\\rangle=1$.\n- **Twist $w$ in that frame.** The same $P_{\\rm phys}$ maps $t^G(w)$ to `tGPzw`, whose vacuum covector is $\\Omega_{zw}$. So $\\Omega_{zw}P_{\\rm phys}$ is a left eigenvector of $t^G(w)$ in the companion frame: the $w$-vacuum state.\n- **Prediction.**\n$$\\Omega_{zw}\\cdot\\Psi_{{\\rm diag},B}=\\big(\\Omega_{zw}P_{\\rm phys}\\cdot y_0\\big)\\,\\frac{\\det N\\big[Q^j_{B,z},\\,Q_{i,{\\rm vac},w}\\big]}{c_0\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle\\,\\Psi_Q^{B,z}(x_0)\\,\\Phi_Q^{{\\rm vac},w}(y_0)}.$$\n  The factor $\\Omega_{zw}P_{\\rm phys}\\cdot y_0$ is the normalization of the bra.\n\nSame point as the mixed-twist cell: $h=1/2$, $\\theta=2/7$, $z=(3/2,5/4,2/3)$, $w=(5/2,7/3,3/5)$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Module[{hT = 1/2, thT = 2/7, zT = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, wT = {5/2, 7/3, 3/5}, prec = 60, ptOf, side, kS, bS, rep, PphN, PphInvN, OmN, x0, y0, kets, psiDiag, wgt, rowM, psiQ, phiQ, nu1, nu3, iVac, tauW, lhs, rhs, frameZ, frameW, omEig, maxc},\n  ptOf[tw_] := {h -> hT, θ[1] -> thT, z[1] -> tw[[1]], z[2] -> tw[[2]], z[3] -> tw[[3]]};\n  (* max |coefficient| in u; the 0 floor matters: an exactly-zero polynomial has an empty coefficient list, Max[{}] = -Infinity, and Ordering sorts -Infinity AFTER numbers *)\n  maxc[e_] := Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[e], 10^-40], u]]], 0];\n  nu1[xx_] := ν[1][xx] /. h -> hT /. θ[1] -> thT; nu3[xx_] := ν[3][xx] /. h -> hT /. θ[1] -> thT;\n  side[tw_] := Module[{pt = ptOf[tw], tGh, mix, evR, vecR, evL, vecL, vals, opD, opU, solve, qd, qu},\n    tGh = Table[Expand[tG[a][u] /. pt], {a, 3}];\n    mix = N[(tGh[[1]] + Pi tGh[[2]]) /. u -> 3/7, prec];\n    {evR, vecR} = Eigensystem[mix]; {evL, vecL} = Eigensystem[Transpose[mix]];\n    vals = Table[With[{k = Ordering[Abs[ψ], -1][[1]]}, Table[Chop[Expand[(N[tGh[[a]], prec] . ψ)[[k]]/ψ[[k]]], 10^-40], {a, 3}]], {ψ, vecR}];\n    opD[tt_, Q_, xx_] := nu1[xx] nu1[xx + hT] nu1[xx + 2 hT] Q[xx - hT] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> xx) nu1[xx + hT] nu1[xx + 2 hT] Q[xx] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> xx + hT) nu1[xx + 2 hT] Q[xx + hT] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> xx + 2 hT) Q[xx + 2 hT];\n    opU[tt_, Q_, xx_] := nu3[xx - hT] nu3[xx - 2 hT] nu3[xx - 3 hT] Q[xx] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> xx - hT) nu3[xx - 2 hT] nu3[xx - 3 hT] Q[xx - hT] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> xx - hT) nu3[xx - 3 hT] Q[xx - 2 hT] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> xx - hT) Q[xx - 3 hT];\n    solve[op_, tt_, zz_, s_] := Module[{c, eqs, ns, res = {}},\n      Do[If[res === {},\n        eqs = CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[op[tt, Function[yy, zz^(s (yy - X)/hT) Sum[c[j] yy^j, {j, 0, d}]], X]], 10^-40], X];\n        ns = If[eqs === {}, {UnitVector[d + 1, d + 1]}, NullSpace[N[Table[Coefficient[e, c[j]], {e, eqs}, {j, 0, d}], prec], Tolerance -> 10^-30]];\n        If[Length[ns] > 0, res = Expand[#/Coefficient[#, X, d]] &[Sum[ns[[1, j + 1]] X^j, {j, 0, d}]]]], {d, 0, 4}]; res];\n    qd = Table[solve[opD, tt, tw[[i]], -1], {tt, vals}, {i, 3}];\n    qu = Table[solve[opU, tt, tw[[j]], 1], {tt, vals}, {j, 3}];\n    <|\"tGh\" -> tGh, \"vals\" -> vals, \"vecR\" -> vecR, \"qd\" -> qd, \"qu\" -> qu,\n      \"QD\" -> Function[{A, i, xx}, N[tw[[i]]^(-xx/hT), prec] (qd[[A, i]] /. X -> xx)], \"QU\" -> Function[{A, j, xx}, N[tw[[j]]^(xx/hT), prec] (qu[[A, j]] /. X -> xx)]|>];\n  kS = side[zT]; bS = side[wT];\n  rep = Join[ptOf[zT], {w[1] -> wT[[1]], w[2] -> wT[[2]], w[3] -> wT[[3]]}];\n  PphN = N[Pphys /. rep, prec]; PphInvN = N[PphysInv /. rep, prec]; OmN = N[Flatten[Ωzw /. rep], prec];\n  (* frame checks: P tG(z) P^-1 = diagonal-twist t1; P tG(w) P^-1 = tGPzw; Ωzw eigencovector of tGPzw *)\n  frameZ = maxc[PphN . N[kS[\"tGh\"][[1]], prec] . PphInvN - N[Sum[ℒ[1][i, i][u - θ[1]] z[i], {i, 3}] /. ptOf[zT], prec]];\n  frameW = maxc[PphN . N[bS[\"tGh\"][[1]], prec] . PphInvN - N[tGPzw[u] /. rep, prec]];\n  tauW = Expand[τvac[u] /. z -> w /. rep];\n  omEig = maxc[OmN . N[tGPzw[u] /. rep, prec] - tauW OmN];\n  (* the w-vacuum among the w-states: t1 eigenvalue = τvac(w) *)\n  iVac = First[Ordering[Table[maxc[bS[\"vals\"][[A, 1]] - tauW], {A, 8}], 1]];\n  x0 = N[Flatten[x[{{2}, {2, 1}}] /. ptOf[zT]], prec]; y0 = N[Flatten[y[{{2}, {2, 1}}] /. ptOf[zT]], prec];\n  kets = Table[v/(x0 . v), {v, kS[\"vecR\"]}];\n  psiDiag = Table[PphN . k, {k, kets}];\n  wgt[n_] := 1/Product[(m - n) hT, {m, DeleteCases[{0, 1, 2}, n]}];\n  rowM[PS_, A_, QS_, B_, {i_, j_}] := Sum[With[{xx = thT - n hT}, wgt[n] {-PS[\"QU\"][A, j, xx] QS[\"QD\"][B, i, xx], PS[\"QU\"][A, j, xx] QS[\"QD\"][B, i, xx + hT], PS[\"QU\"][A, j, xx - hT] QS[\"QD\"][B, i, xx]}], {n, 0, 2}];\n  psiQ[S_, B_] := (S[\"QU\"][B, 2, thT - 2 hT] S[\"QU\"][B, 3, thT - 3 hT] - S[\"QU\"][B, 3, thT - 2 hT] S[\"QU\"][B, 2, thT - 3 hT]) S[\"QU\"][B, 3, thT - hT];\n  phiQ[S_, A_] := (S[\"QD\"][A, 1, thT - 2 hT] S[\"QD\"][A, 2, thT] - S[\"QD\"][A, 2, thT - 2 hT] S[\"QD\"][A, 1, thT]) S[\"QD\"][A, 1, thT - 2 hT];\n  lhs = Table[OmN . psiDiag[[B]], {B, 8}];\n  rhs = Table[(OmN . PphN . y0) Det[rowM[kS, B, bS, iVac, #] & /@ {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}}]/((c0S x0y0 /. h -> hT) psiQ[kS, B] phiQ[bS, iVac]), {B, 8}];\n  diagCheck = {\"P tG(z) P^-1 = diag-twist t1\" -> N[frameZ, 3], \"P tG(w) P^-1 = tGPzw\" -> N[frameW, 3], \"Ωzw eigencovector\" -> N[omEig, 3],\n    \"w-vacuum match to τvac(w)\" -> N[maxc[bS[\"vals\"][[iVac, 1]] - tauW], 3], \"vacuum direct degrees\" -> (Exponent[#, X] & /@ bS[\"qd\"][[iVac]]), \"vacuum dual degrees\" -> (Exponent[#, X] & /@ bS[\"qu\"][[iVac]]),\n    \"min |Ωzw.Ψ|\" -> N[Min[Abs[lhs]], 3], \"max |rhs/lhs - 1|\" -> N[Max[Abs[rhs/lhs - 1]], 3]};\n  ToString[diagCheck, InputForm]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"125\" data-out-n=\"851\" data-sub-idx=\"0\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"74\" data-sub-start=\"0\" data-sub-end=\"43\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[851]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"wolfbook-render-error\" style=\"color:#cc0000;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">[LaTeX error] KaTeX parse error: Undefined control sequence: \\[ at position 105: …GPzw\\&quot; -&gt; 0, \\&quot;\\̲[̲CapitalOmega]zw…<br><small>\\text{&quot;{\\&quot;P tG(z) P${}^{\\wedge}$-1 = diag-twist t1\\&quot; -&gt; 0, \\&quot;P tG(w) P${}^{\\wedge}$-1 = tGPzw\\&quot; -&gt; 0, \\&quot;\\[CapitalOmega]zw eigencovector\\&quot; -&gt; 0, \\&quot;w-vacuum match to \\[Tau]vac(w)\\&quot; -&gt; 0, \\&quot;vacuum direct degrees\\&quot; -&gt; {0, 1, 2}, \\&quot;vacuum dual degrees\\&quot; -&gt; {2, 1, 0}, \\&quot;min |\\[CapitalOmega]zw.\\[CapitalPsi]|\\&quot; -&gt; 0.5950413223140495868$\\grave{ }$3., \\&quot;max |rhs/lhs - 1|\\&quot; -&gt; 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$53.62571330501131}&quot;}</small></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[851]= \\text{\"{\\\"P tG(z) P${}^{\\wedge}$-1 = diag-twist t1\\\" -> 0, \\\"P tG(w) P${}^{\\wedge}$-1 = tGPzw\\\" -> 0, \\\"\\[CapitalOmega]zw eigencovector\\\" -> 0, \\\"w-vacuum match to \\[Tau]vac(w)\\\" -> 0, \\\"vacuum direct degrees\\\" -> {0, 1, 2}, \\\"vacuum dual degrees\\\" -> {2, 1, 0}, \\\"min |\\[CapitalOmega]zw.\\[CapitalPsi]|\\\" -> 0.5950413223140495868$\\grave{ }$3., \\\"max |rhs/lhs - 1|\\\" -> 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$53.62571330501131}\"}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
